sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Gateway as nginx gateway
  participant SPA as frontend SPA
  participant API as backend Daphne
  participant DB as sqlite file
  Browser->>Gateway: HTTP port 80
  Gateway-->>Browser: 301 to HTTPS
  Browser->>Gateway: HTTPS /
  Gateway->>SPA: HTTP frontend:80
  SPA-->>Browser: index.html
  Browser->>Gateway: HTTPS /api
  Gateway->>API: HTTP backend:8000
  API->>DB: read or write
  API-->>Browser: JSON
  Browser->>Gateway: WSS /ws
  Gateway->>API: WebSocket upgrade
  API-->>Browser: chat frames
